sequenceDiagram
    participant Act as act step
    participant API as server (/api/approvals)
    participant Jenny as Jenny (betsy.html)
    Act->>Act: does this decision need a human?
    Act->>API: POST /api/approvals (full purchase order attached)
    Note over Act: the run keeps going, then finishes
    Jenny->>API: POST /api/approvals/{id}/approve
    API->>API: run the saved purchase order -> creates the PO
    Jenny->>API: POST /api/approvals/{id}/reject
    API->>API: mark it resolved, no PO created
